# The chess-context reference copy, deleted 2026-08-01 once the port was done.
# It was deliberately untracked, so removing it moved nothing in git history —
# the authoritative copy lives at github.com/voolyvex/chess-context.
# This entry outlives the directory on purpose: it costs nothing, and it stops a
# future reference copy from being committed by accident. See decisions.md #12.
legacy/

